**Key idea:** A scoreboard matching out-of-order paired transactions must use explicit presence flags to differentiate opposite-port matches from duplicate same-port errors, clone incoming handles to prevent monitor mutation, and implement explicit watchdog cleanup to allow safe ID reuse.

```mermaid
